			(hide yes)
			(uuid "945a100c-7fb0-4a81-a883-6358b4f255c7")
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "VBUS detect divider, high side. VBUS_SENSE = VBUS * R3/(R2+R3) = VBUS * 2/3. Feeds PA0, which is FT_a: 5V-tolerant with NO switchable diode to VDD, so positive injection is impossible (Table 22 note 3) and this cannot back-feed the 3V3 rail while charging with SW7 off. Do NOT move it to PA1/PA3/PA6/PB0-PB2: those are FT_ea, and the _e diode injects up to 5 mA once VIN exceeds VDD (Table 56 / Figure 25). PA0 is also ADC_IN0 and WKUP1."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "b470fa6a-8759-421f-a5b9-0b7df3630e70")
			(effects
